<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO, Smart in $195 mln financing.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO, Smart in $195 mln financing.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO bank and Philippines telecommunications operator Smart Communications have signed an agreement for a syndicated export/project financing of $195 million, ABN AMRO said on Friday.</p>
<p>The ABN AMRO-arranged finance package consists of two offshore tranches of in total $82 million and one onshore tranche of $113 million, ABN AMRO said.</p>
<p>The credit will finance Smart's expansion of its infrastructure as well as contracted deliveries of equipment from Sweden's Ericsson, which contributed to the structuring of the financing, ABN AMRO said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
